g_X^c(Z,Z) &amp;amp;= \|\Omega\|_F^2+\|K\|_F^2 - \frac{1}{2}\|\Omega\|_F^2\\
&amp;amp; = \mathrm{tr}Z^TZ  - \frac{1}{2}\mathrm{tr}Z^TXX^TZ\\
&amp;amp; =\mathrm{tr}\left[Z^T\left(I_n- \frac{1}{2}XX^T\right)Z\right]\\
&amp;amp; = \left&amp;lt;Z,(I_n - \frac{1}{2}XX^T)Z\right&amp;gt;_F
\end{aligned}
