\sum_{i,j} c_i c_j \left&amp;lt;k_{x_i},k_{x_j}\right&amp;gt;_\mathcal{H}&amp;amp; = \sum_{i,j} c_ic_j \left&amp;lt;k(\cdot,x_i),k(\cdot,x_j)\right&amp;gt;_\mathcal{H}\\
&amp;amp; = \left\|\sum_{i} c_i k(\cdot,x_i) \right\|^2_\mathcal{H}\geq 0
\end{aligned}
